@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,sans-serif

title 游戏初始化流程 — 设计 #38

participant "GameCore" as GC
participant "card_def" as CD
participant "Player" as P
participant "random" as R

GC -> CD: ① get_initial_draw_pile()
CD --> GC: 3xATTACK, 2xDEFENSE, 1xENERGY, 1xBUILD

GC -> P: ② Player(hp=30, energy=2, draw_pile=...)
note right: 使用 INITIAL_HP=30\n使用 INITIAL_ENERGY=2
P --> GC: player_1

GC -> P: ③ Player(hp=30, energy=2, draw_pile=...)
P --> GC: player_2

GC -> R: ④ random.shuffle(player_1.draw_pile)
GC -> R: ⑤ random.shuffle(player_2.draw_pile)

GC -> GC: ⑥ _start_cycle()
note right: 洗牌、发5张手牌\n2张留在抽牌堆

@enduml
